1Why🤔 are💯 you🫵 fighting⚔️ and➡️ arguing🗣️? Don’t🚫 those👥 battles⚔️ come🏃 from🙏 selfish💸 cravings💭 fighting⚔️ inside🫀 you🫵—guerre🇫🇷?
2You🫵 want💭 what➡️ you🫵 don’t🚫 have💸, so➡️ you🫵 fight⚔️ and➡️ envy😒; you🫵 still⏳ don’t🚫 get🏁 it🫵 because🙏 you🫵 don’t🚫 ask🙋 God👑.
3Even⚡ when⏱️ you🫵 ask🙏, you🫵 don’t🚫 receive🎁 because🙏 you🫵 ask🙏 with➡️ selfish💸 motives💭, wanting💭 to➡️ spend💸 it🫵 on📍 your👥 own👤 pleasures😋—addu’a🇳🇬, duʿāʾ🕌.
4You🫵 unfaithful💔 people🫂, don’t🚫 you🫵 know🧠 that➡️ being💯 friends🫶 with➡️ the🌍 world🌍 puts📍 you🫵 against⚔️ God👑? Anyone👤 who🙏 chooses✅ the🌍 world🌍 as➡️ a🫶 friend🫶 makes💭 themselves🫂 God’s👑 enemy😈—ìfẹ́🇳🇬.
5Do💭 you🫵 think🧠 Scripture📜 says🗣️ this👆 for🚫 no🚫 reason🧩? The🌬️ Spirit🌬️ God👑 placed📍 in📍 us🫂 longs💭 deeply💯.
6But⚡ God👑 gives🎁 even💯 more💯 grace🎁. Scripture📜 says🗣️: “God👑 stands🧍 against⚔️ the😤 proud😤 but⚡ gives🎁 grace🎁 to➡️ the🧎 humble🧎”—Demut🇩🇪, humildad🇪🇸.
7So➡️ place📍 yourselves🫂 under⬇️ God’s👑 lead🧭. Resist🛡️ the👿 devil👿 and➡️ he👿 will🔜 run🏃 away⬇️ from🙏 you🫵.
8Come🏃 close📍 to➡️ God👑 and➡️ he👑 will🔜 come🏃 close📍 to➡️ you🫵. Wash🧼 your👥 hands🤲, you🫵 who🙏 do💔 wrong🚫; clean🫧 your👥 hearts💛, you🫵 who🙏 can’t🚫 make💭 up⬆️ your👥 minds🧠.
9Take💔 this👆 seriously💯: grieve😢, mourn😢, and➡️ cry😭. Turn🔄 your👥 laughter😄 into➡️ sadness😔 and➡️ your👥 joy😄 into➡️ sorrow💔.
10Humble🧎 yourselves🫂 before➡️ the👑 Lord👑, and➡️ he👑 will🔝 lift⬆️ you🫵 up⬆️.
11Family🫂, don’t🚫 trash-talk🗣️ one➡️ another🫂. Anyone👤 who🙏 slanders🗣️ or➡️ judges⚖️ another👤 is💯 speaking🗣️ against➡️ the📜 law📜 and➡️ acting🎭 as➡️ its👤 judge⚖️ instead🔄 of🙏 obeying✅ it🫵.
12There💯 is💯 one☝️ Lawgiver📜 and➡️ Judge⚖️, who🙏 can💪 save🛟 or➡️ destroy💥. So➡️ who❓ are💭 you🫵 to➡️ judge⚖️ your👥 neighbor🫂?
13Listen👂, unu🇯🇲, you🫵 who🙏 say🗣️, “Today📅 or➡️ tomorrow📅 we🫂 will🔜 go🏃 to➡️ a👤 certain🗺️ city🏙️, stay🏠 a🗓️ year📅, do💼 business💸, and➡️ make💰 money💰”—
14you🫵 don’t🚫 even💯 know🧠 what➡️ tomorrow📅 will🔜 bring🎁. What❓ is💭 your👥 life💚? It🫵 is💨 mist💨 that➡️ shows⬆️ up⬆️ briefly⏱️, then➡️ disappears💨.
15Instead🔄, say🗣️, “If⚠️ the👑 Lord👑 wills💭—volonté🇫🇷—we🫂 will🔜 live💚 and➡️ do💪 this👆 or➡️ that👆”—udo🟩.
16But⚡ now⏱️ you🫵 brag🗣️ about➡️ your👥 arrogant😤 plans🗺️. All💯 that👆 boasting🗣️ is💯 wrong🚫.
17So➡️ if⚠️ you🫵 know🧠 the💚 good✨ you🫵 should💭 do💪 but⚡ don’t🚫 do💪 it🫵, that👆 is💯 sin💔—shalom✡️, paz🇪🇸.